  "description": "C# wrapper for gltfpack - a tool for optimizing glTF/GLB/OBJ files.\n\nFeatures:\n- Mesh compression (EXT_meshopt_compression, KHR_meshopt_compression)\n- Mesh simplification with LOD generation\n- Vertex quantization\n- Animation optimization\n- Texture compression (KTX2/Basis Universal, WebP)\n- GPU instancing support\n\nThis is a C++/CLI wrapper that requires Windows x64 and .NET 8.0.\n\nWINDOWS ONLY: This package only supports Windows x64. It will NOT work on Linux, macOS, or other platforms.",
